            <div xml:id="m-a364ebe7-a049-455a-8917-fa127d95de05">
              <lg xml:id="m-51561186-2ff2-4fb2-99fa-ed5159e9834e">
                <l xml:id="m-a52d547c-4d13-4ace-8c1e-41193c2bc351" facs="#m-ad7816d0-8666-4c4f-8991-ce05195ab66a" label="ambiguous">191</l><l xml:id="m-fdb86abf-16b8-42c5-8b11-90fe038a1fce" facs="#m-5e032238-da4c-41e6-aaae-88404311d57f" label="ambiguous">Benedictus Dominus. 8. G.</l><l xml:id="m-c705c57e-de12-44c0-8360-4198757ae1bb" facs="#m-2ca74820-1a3c-4a95-9125-eff6a623013b" label="lyrics-like">4. Dómine, quid est hómo, quia innotuisti éi? * aut filius hóminis,</l><l xml:id="m-d0759198-7947-40cd-8061-2ebd9bcc6b52" facs="#m-d6630323-1e03-4c9a-a001-02b842bbc298" label="lyrics-like">quia réputas éum?</l><l xml:id="m-1274ded3-12ba-4687-83d8-b5deadb42518" facs="#m-4aa42d05-2a33-4013-8c9d-851e5174eaba" label="lyrics-like">5. Hómo vanitáti similis fáctus est :* dies éjus sicut úmbra praetéreunt.</l><l xml:id="m-7d6e7edc-b21f-4689-90ab-e9e1e732f6c5" facs="#m-f23d1400-4a4d-42d5-b63a-b21152c16091" label="lyrics-like">6. Dómine inclína caélos túos, et descénde :* tánge móntes, et fumi¬</l><l xml:id="m-977c7154-5442-421d-9e38-fe76cd3c59b5" facs="#m-c2cf31a4-7dc9-475a-83c4-a0aa36913229" label="lyrics-like">gábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-69679c4c-cba8-4a5e-a58d-4182957fc424" facs="#m-7b179884-087e-4b9a-9b86-87cd6c67f26a" label="lyrics-like">7. Fúlgura coruscatiónem, et dissipábis éos: “emitte sagittas túas,</l><l xml:id="m-ebe7348d-8d6e-4ae4-af34-f4d33d500f54" facs="#m-a39a1973-97ee-48fc-bb56-d2ab48c018d1" label="lyrics-like">et conturbábis éos.</l><l xml:id="m-3872cb79-cb92-4f72-8328-db609de690f9" facs="#m-dce6f629-4d3d-4dc0-907e-13d5801dc80b" label="lyrics-like">8. Emîtte mánum túam de álto, t éripe me et libera me de áquis</l><l xml:id="m-20fb023f-1421-4760-837b-c92993404754" facs="#m-69125ea0-8786-448f-9c54-09230b5f0e43" label="lyrics-like">múltis:“ de mánu filiórum alienórum.</l><l xml:id="m-b2f0c389-7d92-4489-88ed-f3b7af9ba139" facs="#m-dab5bc2e-b9de-4120-83ab-98af9b00212d" label="lyrics-like">9. Quórum os locútum est vanitátem:* et déxtera eórum, déxtera</l><l xml:id="m-f7225ecf-26cd-433d-9f70-bd996a879bb6" facs="#m-20a5b15b-9cb9-4365-b5f9-cf797fb0bd4c" label="lyrics-like">iniquitãtis.</l><l xml:id="m-53d511a2-4b85-4faa-a0f6-63e5d351c804" facs="#m-08271a4b-f0c2-47b6-baac-ade72a704ae1" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-aba50e76-24bf-4d66-a958-365222b43f41" facs="#m-4ada0666-13ac-484a-9924-f8c80a8957f4" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in principio, et núne, et sémper, *et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-1380384d-b143-49a4-8f2b-21b9aa9ed55c" facs="#m-e8dc0063-02af-4299-877d-4d7850593392" label="lyrics-like">tórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-d6b6640e-8947-4feb-9961-c23ad6af3dd7" facs="#m-c9e533d9-11f5-4972-8b3b-1a7e51c1e605" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. G.</l><l xml:id="m-aa874bea-4d95-45ad-8757-0a828bd539f8" facs="#m-2d528320-6112-4a38-940e-ac8fbf7422de" label="text-like">Ending of 1 accent withz prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-55fdd4ba-4a61-4d4c-a876-b692fa2ffbcf" facs="#m-0ef6effa-c340-48df-8b99-0e1175b04bdc" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-3d2780f7-6146-4a7b-b641-3f82ddfaeeab" facs="#m-2ee1882a-4f60-4fd7-b0d7-ede1b3dc00ef" label="ambiguous">tory syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-e55b6d0a-3f92-402f-a6e3-8f0ed6009c94" facs="#m-055d0055-5dea-4827-aa77-8b8b1608ca56" label="lyrics-like">1. Benedictus Dóminus Dé-us mé-us, qui dócet mánus mé-as ad proé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1335a4bf-a187-480a-9d3a-c3fce49b00aa" facs="#m-24585ba8-45ae-428f-908e-34b690e38311" label="ambiguous">6</l><l xml:id="m-19c1dc93-2d7f-4ce3-9b7e-008ae72a1073" facs="#m-ebd3da99-ec55-4368-8bfb-2f0c98899fc3" label="lyrics-like">li-um, * et digi-tos mé-os ad bél- lum. Flex: de álto, t</l><l xml:id="m-fa05cdfb-5570-4d0c-ac66-d32f7d4d71fc" facs="#m-43723fef-5ea0-4086-b56a-978b0061132a" label="lyrics-like">2. Misericórdia méa et refúgium méum: *suscéptor méus et libe¬</l><l xml:id="m-979f4cbd-fd26-4886-adbb-2ac2414d729b" facs="#m-7017b369-9c12-4071-b46f-34129661e7ed" label="lyrics-like">rátor méus:</l><l xml:id="m-cc432ef4-5cbe-4555-b5f7-7e23ccf22187" facs="#m-63a51dc3-ff7e-4c29-8c12-7ecba3b52d30" label="lyrics-like">3. Protéctor méus et in ipso sperávi:* qui súbdit pópulum méum</l><l xml:id="m-44462197-ade6-4670-9ead-a3ee744af062" facs="#m-81047336-671c-4b31-8fd5-6bf5a966c6d5" label="ambiguous">sub me.</l><l xml:id="m-25c78765-d951-4a58-bf49-a0cde55dcb2a" facs="#m-2cacae1b-eca8-4dfa-bbfb-97740d2b6dcf" label="lyrics-like">4. Dómine, quid est hómo, quia innotuísti éi? *aut filius hóminis,</l><l xml:id="m-10245272-c8cf-4259-8251-18be2274e91a" facs="#m-1d709b10-59f2-4b9a-95e8-9497b63bd45c" label="lyrics-like">quia réputas éum?</l><l xml:id="m-52c0709c-e3bf-423f-abdd-535a7075a6ae" facs="#m-a7e69798-0ec4-4500-a30e-6466ac66bb5b" label="lyrics-like">5. Hómo vanitáti símilis fáctus est:* díes éjus sicut úmbra praetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2528aef-45c7-4903-aec7-7035887f4aa4" facs="#m-bcdfd453-fc45-4a85-bbd6-d6cbea929399" label="ambiguous">eunt.</l><l xml:id="m-cdaa59c8-d7b6-48e6-97aa-4ce4affd5486" facs="#m-e87e6d43-aeb0-4fb8-979d-bb074714bbda" label="lyrics-like">6. Dómine inclina caélos túos, et descénde:*tánge móntes, et fumi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b786a151-0c3e-4104-a563-648b4a97993d" facs="#m-d05d2109-e738-488a-a677-d9655a763686" label="lyrics-like">gábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-bd5fb4fb-19d9-4983-bd24-f48ea472055d" facs="#m-5d53cfc7-ad82-40de-aac9-ad95c55410c0" label="lyrics-like">7. Fúlgura coruscatiónem, et dissipábis éos: * emitte sagíttas túas, et</l><l xml:id="m-d54f8220-d8ba-4405-8f57-028ac83cd433" facs="#m-6941f0cb-e64f-4e76-928e-a7f854c54e1e" label="lyrics-like">conturbábis éos.</l><l xml:id="m-3e90081f-8e92-410a-87ec-339a6c5f1367" facs="#m-bef3823b-bc00-442e-94ac-caca8a7c5f5b" label="lyrics-like">8. Emitte mánum túam de álto, f éripe me et libera me de áquis</l><l xml:id="m-84a2bf31-509f-4212-905a-5a6ff6ed90e2" facs="#m-591ed948-c9e0-44e2-8fa9-32c81e48d884" label="lyrics-like">múltis:* de mánu filiórum alienórum.</l><l xml:id="m-443d79b3-28fc-42ae-a664-b9b3df56ea69" facs="#m-8ddff806-1645-479a-adb8-d939731dc5dd" label="lyrics-like">2.Quórum os locútum est vanitâtem:“et déxtera eórum, déxtera</l><l xml:id="m-736695a5-da22-4e54-ad27-0910caece8de" facs="#m-fe0c09e5-293c-4c55-835a-7b68501582f8" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátis.</l><l xml:id="m-84029c91-270a-4655-8e5c-dcb483473b6d" facs="#m-42ba2ef5-2c00-4edf-af0d-b0ef89df8673" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spirítai Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-07f4d13c-de12-4fbd-9280-affec954649f" facs="#m-44293a61-e1e9-42f1-8170-a61c64a10dd2" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-ceecc5a7-5d5f-4a4c-bae3-1797032b836c" facs="#m-04fa3b1f-55be-494e-af89-e14be190fd1f" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l></lg>
